{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Mr Brennan, in you come. What can I do for you?",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Good morning, Doctor. I am afraid I have had a cough since a dose of the flu, and it has not settled.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (DOCTOR): How long?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Six weeks, Doctor.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (DOCTOR): Worse at any time?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes. It is decidedly worse at night, and it wakes me.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (DOCTOR): Phlegm?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): A small amount of white phlegm. Nothing coloured, Doctor.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): Blood?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): No, Doctor. There has been no blood.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (DOCTOR): Fever?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Not at present. I had a temperature with the flu, but that has passed.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (DOCTOR): Breathless?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Only a little, if I may say, when I climb the stairs.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): Chest pain?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): No, none at all.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): Night sweats?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): No, I have not had night sweats.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): Weight down?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): No, Doctor. I have not lost weight.",
  "[SEG0021] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Sorry for bursting in. The car park was a pure nightmare, and the rain is coming down in sheets.",
  "[SEG0022] person_1 (DOCTOR): You're the carer?",
  "[SEG0023] person_3 (CAREGIVER): I am, yes. Three mornings a week.",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Did ye hear the forecast? Another week of this grey stuff. My sister's young lad had his communion rained off last year, the poor crater, every photo ruined.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): It was a very wet day, certainly. We were speaking of the weather in the waiting room.",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (CAREGIVER): And the traffic on the N6, don't start me. Bumper to bumper from the roundabout. I missed the start of the match on the radio over it.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (DOCTOR): Right. You said no weight loss.",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): Well, actually, I ought to correct myself. I have not stood on a scales, but my trousers are looser at the waist. I could not tell you when that began.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (DOCTOR): Abroad lately?",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (PATIENT): No, Doctor. I have not travelled.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (DOCTOR): Contact with TB?",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (PATIENT): None whatsoever. I have had no such contact.",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Ah now, that's not the way I heard it. Your cousin Niall in Limerick was in the hospital with a bad chest, and they were talking about TB. You called in to see him.",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (PATIENT): With respect, I did not visit Niall. I sent a card only. There has been no contact.",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (DOCTOR): Smoke?",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): I gave the cigarettes up fifteen years ago, Doctor.",
  "[SEG0037] person_1 (DOCTOR): Drink?",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (PATIENT): A single glass of wine on a Sunday. Nothing more.",
  "[SEG0039] person_1 (DOCTOR): Other illnesses?",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (PATIENT): I have high blood pressure, which is looked after.",
  "[SEG0041] person_1 (DOCTOR): Tablets?",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (PATIENT): I take amlodipine, ten milligrams... forgive me, it is five milligrams, once a day, by mouth, for the blood pressure.",
  "[SEG0043] person_1 (DOCTOR): Anything for the cough?",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (PATIENT): The locum prescribed amoxicillin, five hundred milligrams three times a day. I stopped it after five days, as it upset my stomach.",
  "[SEG0045] person_3 (CAREGIVER): The chemist offered him a codeine cough bottle as well, but he never took a drop of it.",
  "[SEG0046] person_2 (PATIENT): That is quite correct. I did not take it.",
  "[SEG0047] person_1 (DOCTOR): Steroid tablets?",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (PATIENT): They were mentioned once, but I was never given them, Doctor.",
  "[SEG0049] person_1 (DOCTOR): Chest is clear. No crackles and no wheeze. The throat is mildly red.",
  "[SEG0050] person_1 (DOCTOR): Pulse eighty-four. Blood pressure one thirty-eight over eighty-two. Temperature thirty-six point six. Saturations ninety-six percent on air, respirations eighteen.",
  "[SEG0051] person_1 (DOCTOR): I'm booking a chest x-ray. I'm not putting a name on the cause today.",
  "[SEG0052] person_2 (PATIENT): I understand entirely. Thank you, Doctor.",
  "[SEG0053] person_1 (DOCTOR): Come back to me in a fortnight with the result.",
  "[SEG0054] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes, Doctor. I shall.",
  "[SEG0055] person_1 (DOCTOR): If you cough up blood, or if you are breathless sitting still, come straight back.",
  "[SEG0056] person_3 (CAREGIVER): I'll have him back if that happens. We'll go now, before the rain gets any heavier.",
  "[SEG0057] person_2 (PATIENT): Thank you for seeing me, Doctor. Good day."
 ],
